cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ImputeBench: A Comprehensive Benchmark for Missing Value Imputation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Edward
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/yourusername/ImputeBench"
keywords:
  - missing value imputation
  - benchmark
  - tabular data
  - machine learning
  - deep learning
  - MCAR
  - MAR
  - MNAR
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, config-driven benchmark platform for systematically
  comparing 13 missing value imputation methods (statistical, ML, deep
  learning) across 12 tabular datasets, 3 missingness mechanisms, and
  multiple evaluation metrics. Includes 17,160 pre-computed experimental
  runs with publication-ready tables, figures, and statistical tests.
